/*
  SnapshotInspector.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0234 · SnapshotInspector (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface (table "SnapshotInspector").
  These entries fold into the app Localizable.xcstrings master catalog at integration
  time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its
  own strings without editing the shared catalog (parallel-safe across the concurrent
  slots).

  The web source (web/src/features/system/components/state-machine/SnapshotInspector.tsx)
  resolves every string through `t('debugger.inspector.*', fallback)`; those keys are
  reproduced verbatim below so the native surface speaks the same catalog. The remaining
  keys back native-only chrome the Apple surface contract requires (the error / retry
  envelope, the live-state freshness chip, the relative-time words used inside the
  outside-window message, and the source-layer badge descriptions — inlined from the web
  `SourceLayerBadge`, whose `sourceLayer.*` keys are reproduced as well). `{{rel}}`,
  `{{value}}`, and `{{n}}` are interpolation tokens replaced at render with the relative
  time, the grouped duration, and a relative magnitude.
*/

/* --- Header (web `debugger.inspector.*`) --- */
